    "text": "By Robert Hayes ,\n16 hours ago WILMINGTON, MA — According to the Wilmington Police Log, Wilmington Police issued the following arrests and summonses between October 10, 2025 and October 16, 2025. Joel Aristides Burgos Colon (42, Nashua, NH) was served a summons for Using An Electronic Device While Operating A Motor Vehicle and Unlicensed Operation Of A Motor Vehicle. (1:57pm) Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
